 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "customerFile and processorFile are CSV datasets: element 0 is the header (distinct column names), every other element a data row with exactly one value per column; values contain no commas or quotes and may be empty. fieldName is a column of both. Return the inner join on equal fieldName values (empty values match each other). The output starts with a header made of the customer header followed by the processor header (both copies of the key column kept), then the data rows, each being the customer values followed by the processor values joined with commas. Customer rows are taken in order and, for each, every matching processor row in order. Customer rows without a match are dropped.",
